  "findings": [
    {
      "priority": 2,
      "file": "third_party/playwright-go/owned_har_close.go",
      "line": 36,
      "title": "Do not block the protocol dispatch owner on an in-flight owned close receipt",
      "body": "A synchronous BrowserContext.OnClose callback that repeats CloseHAROwned waits unconditionally on the same state.done while the first close body can still await channel.Send(\"close\") acknowledgment. SDK connection.Dispatch calls Emit/OnClose synchronously, so this wait blocks the sole decoder from dispatching the first acknowledgment and completing either call. The existing protocol callback waitResult explicitly uses reentrant polling on dispatchGID for synchronous callback calls; this raw channel wait does not. Ordinary Close retains early nil and does not block this callback. APEX internal callbacks currently do not directly call this optional method, so the finding is scoped to the newly exported SDK callback contract.",
      "requested_correction": "Add a deterministic dispatch/OnClose repeat regression. For an incomplete receipt, fail closed or use a safe mechanism that does not block the dispatch owner needed by the physical close; do not return nil until the original complete result exists. Preserve ordinary repeat compatibility and joined results for independent callers.",
      "basis": [
        "third_party/playwright-go/connection.go:200 synchronous channel Emit",
        "third_party/playwright-go/browser_context.go:618 synchronous context close Emit",
        "third_party/playwright-go/browser_context.go:512 close RPC acknowledgment before return",
        "third_party/playwright-go/connection.go protocolCallback.waitResult dispatchGID reentrant polling"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clean_checks": [
    "CAS excludes duplicate entry and retains one reason winner; server/prior ordinary close cannot be adopted.",
    "No state mutex held during physical body or caller wait; complete error/result retained for independent repeat callers.",
    "Named return + completed marker fail closed on error, panic and Goexit; panic semantics preserved for first owner.",
    "Context reason writer uses same lock as effectiveCloseReason reader; entry CAS prevents later ordinary reason mutation.",
    "Context once close completion broadcasts through channel close; ordinary early-nil behavior retained.",
    "Optional APEX binding refuses unsupported/nil SDK context and does not fall back to ordinary Close.",
    "Local replacement keeps upstream pin/native platform selection. All 80 copied pristine hashes verified against cached module; only declared browser_context.go changed.",
    "Six Go dependency-download Docker stages COPY local SDK before go mod download; .dockerignore does not exclude it.",
    "Makefile and main CI explicitly run dependency-module extension tests; root ./... alone is insufficient.",
    "Both recording pull_request/main paths include third_party/playwright-go/** and static path test requires exactly two trigger occurrences."
  ],
